Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within\Nyour dreams, taking aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,for your heart so it would\Nseem Stand tall and read,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,go to hell and jump for\Nparadise Every time dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,dangerous We like it serious, serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,oh Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go The balls filled between us, they\Nwill show Still what we don't know Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,working hard together Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers Got to dream\Ndespite the rivalry Gotta see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It through believing in you.\NThere's even charm in failure. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears\Nin the world we're in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up our thought\Nagain, yeah We're the foolish ones we love,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll carry on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we see the light, the sun will rise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core is\Nagainst myself forevermore Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,let's do it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.65,0:01:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. The bonds built between us,\Nthey will show. So what we don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what we call adventure Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got superpowers. Got to dream\Ndespite the rivalry. Gotta see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It through believing in you.\NThere's even charm in failure. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers Superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers Yes, we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.56,0:02:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the Super Bowers. Super Bowers. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.98,0:02:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we're the Super Bowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you bastards doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not even leaving a scratch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.94,0:02:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing to do with you,\Ntake your captain and escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need you here thought\Nthey could outsmart us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.48,0:03:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make them pay for that.\NThen it just so happens all the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,enemy forces are gathered here\Nfor us to destroy lucky us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that your story?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about Jerma's iron skin is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.78,0:03:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told you were all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.74,0:03:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you survive our attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.66,0:03:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nastort, they had 10,000\Nsoldiers with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that your\Nkingdom defeated them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They were more like a\Nswarm of flies, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.88,0:03:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We swatted them all right\Ninto the sea. You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is Montdor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nastort, please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Basquiat, don't smoke! Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone pick up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.14,0:03:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Scar Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.06,0:03:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since Pecum's betrayed us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:03:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it has been one mauvaise\Nsurprise after another today!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.44,0:04:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And why did Germans fleet up to\Nshow up at home moments crucial?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.44,0:04:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you simpletons think we were\Ngoing to do with our technology anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stick to cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I will murder you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, get moving already. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.34,0:04:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Germa is blasting the crap\Nout of Snack and his fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we go help them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get distracted by their problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our duty is to crush the Straw Hat's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Spread that message to\Nthe fleet. Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Montior dropped the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have been outsmarted by Germa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lest you forget, you were outsmarted too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked my ass off to\Ncome here and help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's hunger pains\Nare still going strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We traded part of ourselves to\Nlive under an emperor's protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.64,0:05:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and then she just\Ndestroys her own kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, it took Strewson days to make that\Ncake, and he's the best in the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.32,0:05:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be long dead before we can throw\Nsomething together like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Lady Pudding can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The cake has to be perfect, and\Nit has to be done right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A cake that'll make Big Mom lick her lips?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.94,0:05:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's tricky. We're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better evacuate, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No way am I waiting around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We should bolt while we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom, where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Fluffy Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Lady Chiffon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's gonna pound that poor girl to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stop a rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.88,0:05:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all due.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Chiffon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.98,0:05:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard they have a cake,\Nbut why'd they bring it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:05:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.66,0:05:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Quarter them already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on with Jerma's fleet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They're attacking the enemy, but do\Nyou think they're here to save us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be their\Nintention as it would have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,been far more convenient\Nfor them to escape Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but if we let our guard down then they\Nmight turn those cannons on us next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.72,0:06:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what their plan might be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, maybe Rachel\Ncame to show me a -
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you guys hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, I'm afraid we can't get any\Ncloser to the island than we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, just sail in the\Ndirection of the harbor at full speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading there as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, is Luffy okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got him, but I\Ncan't talk right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get the ship moving, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Starboard, turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:06:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:06:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Starboard, ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sanji! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.88,0:07:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uchi-ataka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire on Germa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Blackleg go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see a damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.96,0:07:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away,\Nno matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.66,0:08:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy can never be\Nforgiven for what he's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, he didn't trick\NKatakuri and run away to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.34,0:08:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, he faced him head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Barrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna know what really happened\Nin the mirror world, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The strongest fighter in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the man who never faces\Ndefeat and never lies down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Our perfect beautiful brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:09:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He fought that door with Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And he lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.48,0:09:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,your flawless record\Nwas broken by that runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Our brother would never lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat must have cheated!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.12,0:09:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.18,0:09:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make him pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.40,0:09:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then never speak of this again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Slice him to shreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.26,0:10:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bound his face in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.26,0:10:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Grind his bones to dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end, Strawhart!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.78,0:10:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to die! Try!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:10:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Taste my fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Roast him alive, Oven!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Spartan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sultry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ichichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.42,0:11:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Oven?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.94,0:11:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting old, Blackleg!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand him over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.44,0:11:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll Smash you as many times as it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,guillotine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.48,0:12:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.34,0:12:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yonji?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're clear! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.10,0:12:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to look at\Nyou anymore, you lame ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's for General Tazakuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to break it to you,\Nbut you're still too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, Gene.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.56,0:13:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.30,0:13:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightspeed sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.30,0:13:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Henry... Laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oven, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two are about to make\Nit to the coast! Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.86,0:13:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a nice flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.62,0:14:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack, Brownie, Joconda, shoot\Nthose bastards down at the coast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The head in your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.24,0:14:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.15,0:14:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that somebody calling us just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there. We got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.66,0:14:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're moving into range.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire the tear gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,One taste of this and\Nit'll sink like a rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy! What gives?\NSay something! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Samma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.32,0:14:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't lay a finger\Non my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can just run away somehow\Nwhile we're in the east blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.34,0:15:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be free, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.22,0:15:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can live the rest of my life\Nwithout ever seeing Dad's face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink Hornet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really high\Nmaintenance, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Better not let him go, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.04,0:15:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying like a little baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:16:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you can never come\Nback here, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, you're the kindest\Nperson I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.22,0:16:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All members of the fleet, target\NStraw Hat is escaped from the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.36,0:16:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.66,0:17:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.66,0:17:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see him! Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.66,0:17:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonji's coming and he's got Luffy too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.58,0:17:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's as reliable as they come! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is dinner ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Press! Please respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How is Mama doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Veggie? The cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm freaking out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaku Island is a mess! It's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.86,0:17:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is about to get even worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I don't know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lickety-looking at Mama\Nand Buggy at this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:18:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Press, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Buggy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Press lost an arm and didn't\Nhave it treated properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so he's kind of running\Nout of juice at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.97,0:18:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not lickety-relevant, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We are waiting at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.28,0:18:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Right outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fluffy Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.82,0:18:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we wait for her to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.12,0:18:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dempster breaks. Old pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.66,0:18:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry it had to end like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a damn fine ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Saved our tail so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.48,0:18:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Nostra Costello.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So one of three things could\Nhappen next, let me explain:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:19:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,one the cake is poisoned,\Nmama eats it and she dies;
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,two the poison doesn't affect\Nmama but the cake tastes bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll still be Lickety longing for\Ncake and her rampage will continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.84,0:19:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And three,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.75,0:19:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the poison in the cake doesn't affect\Nher and miraculously it tastes good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only scenario\Nwhere we Lickety live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lickety, like it or not, our fate\Nrests entirely on that wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.68,0:19:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,C 'est une catastrophe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole country knows by now it's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear nuts island\Ngot wrecked pretty bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.64,0:19:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not gonna be\Nanything left of Total Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:20:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,with this like your team\Nand the cake is the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.56,0:20:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, where did\Nmorgan's and Sexy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They left the island a little while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.34,0:20:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll tell the whole\Nworld about this disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.12,0:20:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture them before they get too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir, damn it that's\Nthe last thing we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.32,0:20:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Our failures on the front\Npage of the newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That bird wouldn't pass\Nup on such a huge scoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.04,0:20:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This island is cursed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.76,0:20:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna end up as a trash\Nheap, just like Nuts Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Chabon betrayed us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't count on her\Nor that traitor Veggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.90,0:20:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get yourself\Nkilled, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.43,0:20:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is going to be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.34,0:20:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the cake that Blackleg baked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.66,0:20:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who trained him, but his\Ncooking is the finest I've ever witnessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's hunger pangs will stop here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.36,0:21:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Vito, Kaido, go nab a\Nship and blow this joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and Shifan will catch up to you\Nonce this little matter is settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.78,0:21:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We paid off our debt to the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It did cost us... our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They better survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't put my ass on the\Nline just for them to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.84,0:21:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamma, mamma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.06,0:21:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.42,0:22:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.33,0:22:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Heck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.54,0:22:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.58,0:22:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bloopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.08,0:22:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,City! Bloopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.02,0:22:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bloopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.96,0:22:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so worried! My door! Our floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.30,0:22:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing, you're all worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.84,0:22:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid work, the both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.42,0:22:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain's in suspense, huh? Carrot...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.24,0:22:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What took you so long? Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.18,0:22:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So, did you knock out Katakuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.54,0:22:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.82,0:22:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so proud that you're my captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell asleep? No surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.52,0:22:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, those wounds are fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.26,0:22:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, Chopper, he's bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, you need to do some\Ndoctoring on the double.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.40,0:22:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.52,0:23:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, you too, you got shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This, it's nothing, don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.32,0:23:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Treat Luffy first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.68,0:23:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.14,0:23:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They caught up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.54,0:23:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We got too distracted!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.44,0:23:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll just have to keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.76,0:23:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Treat him while we sail away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.56,0:23:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.52,0:24:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What now? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.66,0:24:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chairman's backing them\Nup! Damn it! You're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.60,0:24:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we return fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.84,0:24:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.58,0:24:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fighting at the coast as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.80,0:24:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't do much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.24,0:24:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire on Straw Hat! Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.98,0:25:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think Sanji's worth all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.60,0:25:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a fool, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.48,0:25:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You courted death coming\Ninto an Emperor's territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.74,0:25:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory was never possible. Only\Nretreat. What could this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.16,0:25:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,failure possibly offer you in\Nreturn he's useless just a failed
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.54,0:25:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,experiment his skin is soft\Nhe bleeds when he's struck
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.76,0:25:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,despite his royal status he's\Ncontent to work as a lowly chef
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.28,0:25:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His heart is easily swayed.\NHe sacrifices himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.16,0:25:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,for the weak even if he\Ndestroys himself in the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.90,0:26:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.08,0:26:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all the help!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.78,0:26:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask you a question, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.52,0:26:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.30,0:26:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dad's weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.90,0:26:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but he sure had a lot of nice stuff\Nto say about you all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.20,0:26:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean—you thought\Nhe was complimenting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.80,0:26:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a delight, always.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.46,0:26:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally—they
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.00,0:26:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,noticed that's a buttload of\Nships—damn it, they cut us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.00,0:26:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.48,0:26:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,circled from the other side of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.28,0:26:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape—no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.36,0:27:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,we're already in their range—no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.28,0:27:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too slow—drop your card
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.12,0:27:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and pay the price, you fool—no\Ncarrot, never mind the fleet!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.70,0:27:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,fool no carrot never mind the fleet I'll\Ncut you down on the spot. Did you wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.00,0:27:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.98,0:27:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Greg?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.14,0:27:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Suchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.14,0:27:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That was huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.68,0:27:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally got close enough\Nfor my power to reach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.04,0:27:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.58,0:27:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Like playing the bowling hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.76,0:27:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.58,0:27:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they all get here so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.80,0:27:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered myself, but look closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.82,0:27:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all paddle ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.00,0:27:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.40,0:27:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.80,0:27:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.62,0:27:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Our victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.98,0:28:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Snatched away at the last moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.38,0:28:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up the assault!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.00,0:28:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the sea lifting up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.88,0:28:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You better leave the boss\Nalone, you bunch of jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.76,0:28:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you're gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.68,0:28:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.64,0:28:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't he from Hoardy's crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.34,0:28:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.32,0:28:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Waratsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.92,0:28:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.36,0:28:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.74,0:28:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Jibbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.28,0:28:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.58,0:29:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to say goodbye, Captain Sham!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.30,0:29:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, or a former captain, we mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.08,0:29:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll guide you to\Nsafety just once more, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.24,0:29:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, for old times' sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.36,0:29:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I say no?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.74,0:29:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.65,0:29:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.34,0:29:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.98,0:29:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna leak!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.32,0:29:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think someone's\Nattacking us from below, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.98,0:29:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I see fishmen down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.38,0:29:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sneaky bastards, that's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.74,0:29:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come up here and fight for real, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.00,0:29:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.08,0:30:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.99,0:30:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the Straw Hats escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.08,0:30:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ocean current!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.08,0:30:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoulder throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.24,0:30:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.18,0:30:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They opened a path for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.40,0:30:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll hold them back for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.46,0:30:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,don't worry—you won't lay a finger\Non their ship, not on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.96,0:31:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.28,0:31:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you all, why didn't I notice sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.36,0:31:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They disabled the territory slugs too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.06,0:31:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Too, we'd all be dead without their help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.22,0:31:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And here they've come to save me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.94,0:31:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Jinbe, your friends\Nsure are great, huh? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.32,0:31:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,See you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.42,0:31:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.38,0:31:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of Jinbe for us, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.16,0:31:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.50,0:31:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.14,0:31:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.16,0:31:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.40,0:31:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now merge!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.46,0:32:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oven, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.46,0:32:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you need to stay on Cacao Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.26,0:32:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.18,0:32:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrel will take care of Jeremiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.74,0:32:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can withstand these\Nheavy metal composite rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.56,0:32:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even Jerma's precious raid suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.28,0:32:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go teach those pesky rats a\Nlesson for me! Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.28,0:32:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That oven guy is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.64,0:32:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will avenge Katakuri if\Nit's the last thing I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.46,0:32:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get out alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.70,0:33:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens next?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.72,0:33:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Have faith, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.62,0:33:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.06,0:33:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who baked that\Ncake is a chef among chefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.06,0:33:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackleg, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.32,0:33:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take all night\Nif you do it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.78,0:33:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't cut corners.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.66,0:33:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.12,0:33:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.72,0:33:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.34,0:33:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you grinning about?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.20,0:33:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a life-or-death situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.58,0:33:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your entire crew could die!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.82,0:33:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more than that, this whole\Ncountry could get wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.76,0:33:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.67,0:33:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just thinking of Big\NMom and how happy she's
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.94,0:33:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna be when she finally gets her cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.72,0:33:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares if she's happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.00,0:33:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She's trying to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.78,0:34:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.40,0:34:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the poison knocked her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.26,0:34:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This day is so lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.28,0:34:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I could die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.66,0:34:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so sweet and fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.48,0:34:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.30,0:34:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My wedding cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.44,0:34:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.44,0:34:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's okay.?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.62,0:34:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure those bastards poisoned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.90,0:35:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mama's too powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.64,0:35:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall sell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.92,0:35:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.32,0:35:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you could see how\Nhappy she is, Blackleg.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.70,0:35:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How sweet this treat, a fabulous feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.44,0:35:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So nostalgic, oh, where\Nis it from? Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.62,0:35:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.20,0:35:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,To all citizens of Tootoland.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.24,0:35:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's rampage has ended at lickety split.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.84,0:35:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the work of Mama's\Nthirty-fifth daughter, putting herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.22,0:35:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's hunger banks have been\Nsatiated! Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.10,0:35:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're very close to Kaku Island, so\NI was certain we'd be next. Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.26,0:35:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're safe now, little buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.50,0:36:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.58,0:36:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding to capture that\Ntraitor she fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.22,0:36:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She knew exactly what she needed to bake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.36,0:36:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The perfect cake for Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.00,0:36:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lady Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.12,0:36:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.48,0:36:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.78,0:36:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you, Lady Pudding. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.88,0:36:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.68,0:36:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Best catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.76,0:36:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.98,0:36:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.12,0:36:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,finish!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.18,0:36:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Marking...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.58,0:36:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiction!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.58,0:36:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tropical torment!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.36,0:37:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.30,0:37:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dive deeper down before you boil!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.68,0:37:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too hot, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.50,0:37:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.54,0:37:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That takes care of your\Nbackup, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.94,0:37:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nowhere left to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.86,0:37:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good. Oh, babe! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.32,0:37:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.74,0:37:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we got this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.22,0:38:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Snatch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.32,0:38:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Snatch it, Snatch it, Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.24,0:38:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Snatch it, madge it, Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.80,0:38:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Delish, delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.08,0:38:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.38,0:38:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A flavor like none other that\Nthe world has never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.04,0:38:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The sort of splendid sweetness you\Nmight taste in a dream. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.68,0:38:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.66,0:38:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why could it be a flavor that's so mighty?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.10,0:38:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It brings back your dead puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.34,0:39:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Orchiddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.40,0:39:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fluffy as can be,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.32,0:39:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,sweet as can be,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.86,0:39:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,just a touch,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.16,0:39:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,risky,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.38,0:39:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,goodness,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.08,0:39:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,oh my, look at the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.94,0:39:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.10,0:39:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Anchoring fires.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.14,0:39:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And shimmering sparks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.06,0:39:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A rainbow of shrapnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.32,0:39:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And a stroll in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.68,0:39:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.82,0:39:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.04,0:39:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sergeant Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.74,0:39:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.88,0:40:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, would you like a bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.66,0:40:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A flavor that's covered in light.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.56,0:40:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel it in my soul shining bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.34,0:40:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's just like that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.34,0:40:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The flavor of joy, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.20,0:40:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Lin-Lin, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.66,0:40:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe someday, not so far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.62,0:40:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat together, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.40,0:40:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh this and be, sweet as can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.58,0:40:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And just a touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.98,0:40:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.42,0:41:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Martha, can I pull this off?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.18,0:41:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.36,0:41:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is happy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.24,0:41:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Peaceful days without a fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.34,0:41:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Every race is welcome too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.58,0:41:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let your dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.58,0:41:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you try to leave,\NI'll run you right through.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.20,0:41:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to sign your soul away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.64,0:41:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The prize for a peaceful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.58,0:41:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we're all a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.42,0:41:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't defy her majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.58,0:41:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,BIT MORE!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.58,0:42:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.44,0:42:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.58,0:42:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just delish!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.68,0:42:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What a great meal!
